* .+DS3EDT   ;	DL4EDT,	DS4EDT=	11	/ EDITOR MATH - USED WHEN NOT IN LP
* .+DS4EDT   ;	DLSTAT,	DSSTAT=	7	/ EDITOR SWAP AREA CODE     (WCE +1)
