* .+DSEHL2   ;	DLFTHL, DSFTHL=2	/ 1 block for fallback table II	/a093
* .+DSFTHL								/a093


	IFZERO .-400&4000 <?DLALOCKBLOCKHASBEENCLOBBERED>

